
@{
    Layout = "_ClientSite";
}

<div style="margin: 30px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 28px;">
    <div>
        如果您是通过微信进入支付页面，但需要支付宝支付，请点击右上角【...】，<span style="font-weight: bold">复制链接</span>到浏览器或直接选择<span style="font-weight: bold">在浏览器中打开</span>，即可使用支付宝支付
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img alt="" style="width: 80%" src="/static/client/images/wechat_open_browser.png"/>
    </div>

    <br/>

    <div>或也可<a onclick="copyUrl()" style="cursor: pointer;font-weight: bold;">复制</a>下面URL到浏览器。</div>
    <div>
        @(Model.Url) <a onclick="copyUrl()" style="cursor: pointer;font-weight: bold;">复制</a>
    </div>
</div>

<script type="text/javascript">
    function copyUrl() {
        var txtUrlAutoCopy = $("<input id='txtUrlCopy' type='text' value='@(Model.Url)' />").appendTo('body');
        txtUrlAutoCopy[0].select();
        document.execCommand("Copy");
        txtUrlAutoCopy.remove();
        
        $.msg.show("复制URL成功，请粘贴到浏览器！", { icon: 1, time: 2000});   
    }
</script>